# Solreign weird chemistry — reagent strings
# (pattern: Resources/Locale/en-US/reagents/meta/fun.ftl + narcotics effect popups)

reagent-name-solreign-liquid-ambition = liquid ambition
reagent-desc-solreign-liquid-ambition = Distilled drive in a convenient acid-green format. Briefly convinces your legs that the quarterly targets are achievable. Overconsumption leads to burnout, which is on you, not the beverage.

reagent-name-solreign-compliance-serum = compliance serum
reagent-desc-solreign-compliance-serum = A calming cyan tonic developed by Solreign People Operations. Induces spontaneous politeness, queue formation, and the occasional crisp salute. Side effects include saying "per my last message" out loud.

reagent-name-solreign-rainbow-juice = rainbow juice
reagent-desc-solreign-rainbow-juice = The corporate unicorn's preferred vintage, pressed fresh from lumen melons. Tastes like sparkles, morale, and a fully-approved expense report.

reagent-name-solreign-synergy = synergy
reagent-desc-solreign-synergy = The measurable output of two departments cooperating. Restores a small, pre-budgeted amount of well-being. Not a substitute for medical attention, vacation, or friendship.

reagent-name-solreign-lumen-sap = lumen sap
reagent-desc-solreign-lumen-sap = Faintly glowing syrup harvested from Solreign glow crops. Nutritious, luminous, and fully compliant with workplace lighting standards.

reagent-name-solreign-overtime-oil = overtime oil
reagent-desc-solreign-overtime-oil = A dark, earnest brew from mushrooms that work the night shift. Keeps your eyelids on payroll. Solreign reminds you that rest is also a deliverable.

# Effect popups

solreign-ambition-effect-deadlines = You suddenly believe in deadlines.
solreign-ambition-effect-spreadsheet = You feel an urge to open a spreadsheet and WIN.
solreign-ambition-effect-burnout = Your ambition writes a check your knees can't cash.

solreign-compliance-effect-please = You feel an overwhelming urge to say "please."
solreign-compliance-effect-thankyou = You feel deeply, inexplicably grateful. Thank you.
solreign-compliance-effect-handbook = You briefly recall the entire employee handbook. It was beautiful.
solreign-compliance-effect-queue = You feel like forming an orderly queue, alone.

solreign-rainbow-effect-sparkles = You taste sparkles.
solreign-rainbow-effect-unicorn = Somewhere, a corporate unicorn nods approvingly.
solreign-rainbow-effect-colors = You can hear colors. They're saying nice things.

solreign-synergy-effect-aligned = You feel aligned with the quarterly roadmap.

solreign-lumensap-effect-luminous = You feel faintly luminous.

solreign-overtime-effect-awake = You are EXTREMELY awake.
solreign-overtime-effect-shift = The night shift welcomes you as one of its own.
